    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Shard Certificate Information</para>
<para>Represents X.509 certificate extensions specific to shard identity. These extensions are parsed from the certificate and used for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Shard identification and authentication</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Capability-based access control</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Token range assignment</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Datacenter/rack locality </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
